599	 * Extracts result[0].text into text_out.
600	 * Returns: 1 = got final result, 0 = intermediate, negative = error
601	 *
602	 * Volcengine binary protocol layout varies by message type:
603	 *
604	 *   Normal response (msg_type 0x9):
605	 *     [4B header] [4B payload_size] [payload...]
